 "description": "The FastIron SX series chassis devices are modular switches that provide the enterprise network with a complete end-to-end Enterprise LAN solution. The ICX series is an access layer Gigabit Ethernet switch designed from the ground up for the enterprise data center environment. Brocade ICX 6450 switches provide stackable LAN switching solutions to meet the growing demands of campus networks, and the Brocade ICX 7750 is a 10/40 GbE Ethernet switch. The Brocade ICX7250 Switch delivers the performance and scalability required for enterprise Gigabit Ethernet (GbE) access deployments.",
